{
  "version": 1,
  "minor_version": 1,
  "key": "lovelace.dashboard_pool",
  "data": {
    "config": {
      "views": [
        {
          "title": "Pool",
          "path": "pool",
          "icon": "mdi:pool",
          "type": "sections",
          "max_columns": 4,
          "sections": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "heading": "Jetzt",
                  "heading_style": "title",
                  "icon": "mdi:waves"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 5,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_ph",
                  "name": "pH",
                  "icon": "mdi:ph",
                  "color": "cyan",
                  "vertical": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_chlorine",
                  "name": "Chlor",
                  "icon": "mdi:flask-outline",
                  "color": "teal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_water_temperature",
                  "name": "Wassertemperatur",
                  "icon": "mdi:thermometer-water",
                  "color": "blue"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_water_level",
                  "name": "Wasserstand",
                  "icon": "mdi:waves-arrow-up",
                  "color": "light-blue"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.aseko_display_rs485_filtration",
                  "name": "Filtration",
                  "icon": "mdi:pump",
                  "color": "indigo"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.aseko_display_rs485_electrolysis",
                  "name": "Elektrolyse",
                  "icon": "mdi:lightning-bolt",
                  "color": "amber"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.aseko_display_rs485_ph_dosing",
                  "name": "pH− Dosierung",
                  "icon": "mdi:water-minus",
                  "color": "deep-orange"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.aseko_display_rs485_heating",
                  "name": "Heizung",
                  "icon": "mdi:radiator",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.aseko_display_rs485_filling",
                  "name": "Nachfüllen",
                  "icon": "mdi:water-plus",
                  "color": "light-blue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "heading": "Sollwerte",
                  "heading_style": "title",
                  "icon": "mdi:target"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 3,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_ph",
                  "name": "pH",
                  "min": 6.5,
                  "max": 8.0,
                  "needle": true,
                  "segments": [
                    {
                      "from": 6.5,
                      "color": "#e67e22"
                    },
                    {
                      "from": 6.8,
                      "color": "#27ae60"
                    },
                    {
                      "from": 7.4,
                      "color": "#e67e22"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_chlorine",
                  "name": "Chlor mg/L",
                  "min": 0,
                  "max": 3,
                  "needle": true,
                  "segments": [
                    {
                      "from": 0,
                      "color": "#e74c3c"
                    },
                    {
                      "from": 0.3,
                      "color": "#27ae60"
                    },
                    {
                      "from": 1.5,
                      "color": "#e67e22"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_water_temperature",
                  "name": "Temp °C",
                  "min": 10,
                  "max": 35,
                  "needle": true,
                  "segments": [
                    {
                      "from": 10,
                      "color": "#3498db"
                    },
                    {
                      "from": 18,
                      "color": "#27ae60"
                    },
                    {
                      "from": 28,
                      "color": "#e67e22"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 3,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "entity",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_ph_setpoint",
                  "name": "pH Soll",
                  "icon": "mdi:target"
                },
                {
                  "type": "entity",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_chlorine_setpoint",
                  "name": "Chlor Soll",
                  "icon": "mdi:target"
                },
                {
                  "type": "entity",
                  "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_temperature_setpoint",
                  "name": "Temp Soll",
                  "icon": "mdi:target"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "heading": "Verlauf 24 Stunden",
                  "heading_style": "title",
                  "icon": "mdi:chart-timeline-variant"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
                  "header": {
                    "show": true,
                    "title": "pH & Chlor",
                    "show_states": true,
                    "colorize_states": true
                  },
                  "graph_span": "24h",
                  "update_interval": "1min",
                  "apex_config": {
                    "chart": {
                      "height": 280
                    },
                    "legend": {
                      "show": true
                    },
                    "stroke": {
                      "curve": "smooth",
                      "width": 2
                    },
                    "tooltip": {
                      "shared": true
                    }
                  },
                  "yaxis": [
                    {
                      "id": "ph",
                      "min": 6.5,
                      "max": 8.0,
                      "decimals": 2,
                      "apex_config": {
                        "title": {
                          "text": "pH"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "cl",
                      "opposite": true,
                      "min": 0,
                      "max": "auto",
                      "decimals": 2,
                      "apex_config": {
                        "title": {
                          "text": "mg/L"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "series": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_ph",
                      "name": "pH",
                      "yaxis_id": "ph",
                      "stroke_width": 3,
                      "color": "#00bcd4",
                      "show": {
                        "extremas": true
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_ph_setpoint",
                      "name": "pH Soll",
                      "yaxis_id": "ph",
                      "stroke_width": 1,
                      "stroke_dash": 4,
                      "color": "#80deea",
                      "show": {
                        "in_header": false
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_chlorine",
                      "name": "Chlor",
                      "yaxis_id": "cl",
                      "stroke_width": 3,
                      "color": "#009688",
                      "show": {
                        "extremas": true
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_chlorine_setpoint",
                      "name": "Chlor Soll",
                      "yaxis_id": "cl",
                      "stroke_width": 1,
                      "stroke_dash": 4,
                      "color": "#80cbc4",
                      "show": {
                        "in_header": false
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
                  "header": {
                    "show": true,
                    "title": "Wassertemperatur",
                    "show_states": true,
                    "colorize_states": true
                  },
                  "graph_span": "24h",
                  "update_interval": "1min",
                  "apex_config": {
                    "chart": {
                      "height": 260
                    },
                    "stroke": {
                      "curve": "smooth",
                      "width": 3
                    },
                    "fill": {
                      "type": "gradient",
                      "gradient": {
                        "shadeIntensity": 0.4,
                        "opacityFrom": 0.45,
                        "opacityTo": 0.05
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "series": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_water_temperature",
                      "name": "Temp",
                      "color": "#1e88e5",
                      "type": "area",
                      "show": {
                        "extremas": true
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_temperature_setpoint",
                      "name": "Soll",
                      "color": "#90caf9",
                      "stroke_dash": 4,
                      "stroke_width": 2
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "heading": "7 Tage",
                  "heading_style": "title",
                  "icon": "mdi:calendar-week"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
                  "header": {
                    "show": true,
                    "title": "pH · Chlor · Temperatur (7 Tage)",
                    "show_states": false
                  },
                  "graph_span": "7d",
                  "update_interval": "5min",
                  "apex_config": {
                    "chart": {
                      "height": 300
                    },
                    "stroke": {
                      "curve": "smooth",
                      "width": 2
                    },
                    "legend": {
                      "position": "top"
                    }
                  },
                  "yaxis": [
                    {
                      "id": "ph",
                      "decimals": 2,
                      "min": "auto",
                      "max": "auto"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "cl",
                      "opposite": true,
                      "decimals": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "temp",
                      "opposite": true,
                      "decimals": 1,
                      "show": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "series": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_ph",
                      "name": "pH",
                      "yaxis_id": "ph",
                      "color": "#00bcd4",
                      "group_by": {
                        "duration": "30m",
                        "func": "avg"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_chlorine",
                      "name": "Chlor",
                      "yaxis_id": "cl",
                      "color": "#009688",
                      "group_by": {
                        "duration": "30m",
                        "func": "avg"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.aseko_display_rs485_water_temperature",
                      "name": "Temp",
                      "yaxis_id": "temp",
                      "color": "#1e88e5",
                      "group_by": {
                        "duration": "30m",
                        "func": "avg"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "heading": "PoolLab (Handmessung)",
                  "heading_style": "title",
                  "icon": "mdi:test-tube"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 2,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "entities",
                  "title": "Letzte PoolLab Messung",
                  "entities": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.pool_gus20_pl_ph",
                      "name": "pH"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.pool_gus20_pl_chlorine_free",
                      "name": "Frei Chlor"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.pool_gus20_pl_chlorine_total",
                      "name": "Gesamt Chlor"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.pool_gus20_pl_alkalinity",
                      "name": "Alkalität"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.pool_gus20_pl_cyanuric_acid",
                      "name": "Cyanursäure"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "**ASIN Salt** liefert Live-Werte über RS485 Display.\n\n**PoolLab** ist die manuelle Referenzmessung.\n\nCloud (Aseko Live) bleibt unverändert über Ethernet."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}